    "detailed_description": "Imagine an outlaw shooter with easily recognizable elements, whether that be an abandoned depot or an underprivileged area of the depressed city you grew up in or tried to avoid. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/5daba1df8eb6d7d4fe3b29b1eee1e19b.poster.avif?t=1724406876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/5daba1df8eb6d7d4fe3b29b1eee1e19b.webm?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/5daba1df8eb6d7d4fe3b29b1eee1e19b.mp4?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Tacticool, Outlaw, Military, Guerilla, and Special Ops assemble into Squads, complete Missions, and build a strong brotherhood in Clans. Here, you can make your own military story alone or gather an army of like-minded people. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/ed4f0766139d71d87948737ccebbb5d0.poster.avif?t=1724406876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/ed4f0766139d71d87948737ccebbb5d0.webm?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/ed4f0766139d71d87948737ccebbb5d0.mp4?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Do you enjoy rushing into a gunfight or sniping enemies from a hidden spot? With over 32 operators and 40 kinds of weapons, you can play however you like. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/5b6db0766aa39007eceb093a385037b7.poster.avif?t=1724406876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/5b6db0766aa39007eceb093a385037b7.webm?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/5b6db0766aa39007eceb093a385037b7.mp4?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>When you want to create pure chaos without a tinge of guilt, jump into PvE Mode and smash zombies on repeat. Want to be king of the hill? Battle Royale mode is at your service. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/fa125cf884dfe4b382b23fc01fa9b067.poster.avif?t=1724406876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/fa125cf884dfe4b382b23fc01fa9b067.webm?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/fa125cf884dfe4b382b23fc01fa9b067.mp4?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Car shootouts are a special kind of tacticool pleasure. You can literally run your enemies into the ground and smash through walls and fences! In this world, a rollover vehicle is truly priceless. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/344572a05792a33c688c5e82f0366fb9.poster.avif?t=1724406876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/344572a05792a33c688c5e82f0366fb9.webm?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/344572a05792a33c688c5e82f0366fb9.mp4?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to the Tacticool brotherhood, soldier! Let the battle begin!",
    "about_the_game": "Imagine an outlaw shooter with easily recognizable elements, whether that be an abandoned depot or an underprivileged area of the depressed city you grew up in or tried to avoid. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/5daba1df8eb6d7d4fe3b29b1eee1e19b.poster.avif?t=1724406876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/5daba1df8eb6d7d4fe3b29b1eee1e19b.webm?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/5daba1df8eb6d7d4fe3b29b1eee1e19b.mp4?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Tacticool, Outlaw, Military, Guerilla, and Special Ops assemble into Squads, complete Missions, and build a strong brotherhood in Clans. Here, you can make your own military story alone or gather an army of like-minded people. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/ed4f0766139d71d87948737ccebbb5d0.poster.avif?t=1724406876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/ed4f0766139d71d87948737ccebbb5d0.webm?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/ed4f0766139d71d87948737ccebbb5d0.mp4?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Do you enjoy rushing into a gunfight or sniping enemies from a hidden spot? With over 32 operators and 40 kinds of weapons, you can play however you like. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/5b6db0766aa39007eceb093a385037b7.poster.avif?t=1724406876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/5b6db0766aa39007eceb093a385037b7.webm?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/5b6db0766aa39007eceb093a385037b7.mp4?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>When you want to create pure chaos without a tinge of guilt, jump into PvE Mode and smash zombies on repeat. Want to be king of the hill? Battle Royale mode is at your service. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/fa125cf884dfe4b382b23fc01fa9b067.poster.avif?t=1724406876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/fa125cf884dfe4b382b23fc01fa9b067.webm?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/fa125cf884dfe4b382b23fc01fa9b067.mp4?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Car shootouts are a special kind of tacticool pleasure. You can literally run your enemies into the ground and smash through walls and fences! In this world, a rollover vehicle is truly priceless. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/344572a05792a33c688c5e82f0366fb9.poster.avif?t=1724406876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/344572a05792a33c688c5e82f0366fb9.webm?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409060/extras/344572a05792a33c688c5e82f0366fb9.mp4?t=1724406876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to the Tacticool brotherhood, soldier! Let the battle begin!",
    "short_description": "Top-down tactical shooter. Team-based 5v5 battles with destructible environment and car chases await you. Enjoy PvP and PvE modes, clan battles, special in-game events, and find new friends in the 30 million-strong Tacticool brotherhood!",
